Package: rdomains
Title: Get the Category of Content Hosted by a Domain
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("Gaurav", "Sood", email = "gsood07@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fetch website content and classify it through the Python 'piedomains'
    text model. Look up domains in 'UT-Capitole', Steven Black, university, archived
    'Shallalist' and 'DMOZ' lists, or use 'VirusTotal' <https://www.virustotal.com/>,
    'OpenAI' and 'Anthropic' APIs. Report collection outcomes and source provenance.
    Includes a historical domain-name classifier trained on 'Shallalist' data.
URL: https://themains.github.io/rdomains/, https://github.com/themains/rdomains
BugReports: https://github.com/themains/rdomains/issues
